   215→/**
   216→ * PeriodSelector Component
   217→ *
   218→ * Tabs for selecting a time period (7, 30, or 90 days).
   219→ * Used in timeline and trend views.
   220→ *
   221→ * @example
   222→ * ```tsx
   223→ * <PeriodSelector
